PASS TXT_PUT8: one letter draws exactly its glyph bits
PASS TXT_PUT8 x2: four times the pixels, BX on by 16
PASS transparent: ink + untouched background = 64000
PASS style 1: ink whole, a shadow beside it
PASS style 2: ink whole, the ring at the letter edge
PASS TXT_PUT4: H = 11 pixels, h the same, BX on by 4
PASS letters half off either edge never wrap
PASS TXT_NUMSTR: 0, 65535, 007, 12345 too wide runs long
PASS TXT_NUMK: 1.4K, 65.5K, 999
PASS TXT_SNUM -12 draws what "-12" draws
PASS TXT_WIDTH: HELLO 40 in 8x8, 40 in 4x6 x2
PASS TXT_BOX: box + letters fill 24*14 exactly
DTEXT: all checks PASS
TXT_DOS, TXT_DOSNUM: 12345 (TXT_DOSZ)
